{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Wearable Dwarf Helm is a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be ",["l","裁缝","tailored"]," using ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," and either a ",["l","矮人头盔","Dwarvish Helm"]," or ",["l","矮人小工具","Dwarf Gadget"]," at the sewing machine inside ",["l","柳巷2号","Emily's house"],", or the ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," received as a reward for the ",["l","任务","\"Rock Rejuvenation\""]," special order."]],["p",["There is a small chance to receive this hat from slaying ",["l","怪物","monsters"],", breaking ",["l","矿井","crates and barrels"],", chopping ",["l","树","trees"],", shaking trees with seeds, digging ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s, or by ",["l","淘盘","panning"],"."]]]]]}